Name: ccferry-__PRODUCT__
Version: __VERSION__
Release: 1%{?dist}
Summary: ccferry __PRODUCT__ (single-package build)
License: Proprietary
BuildArch: __RPMARCH__
Source0: staging.tar.gz
%description
Bun-compiled ccferry __PRODUCT__ binary (see docs/deploy-daemon.md).
%prep
%setup -q -T -c -n ccferry-__PRODUCT__
%build
%install
tar -xzf %{SOURCE0} -C %{buildroot} --strip-components=1
%files
/*
